{
  "_comment": "B1 双树漂移根治：agent 运行时文件清单。source=upstream/hermes-agent（工作树镜像），dest=~/.hermes/hermes-agent（运行时安装树）。inject 出口经 deploy-agent-runtime 自动同步，杜绝'修复只在工作树、不达运行时'（room-invite-gap 真根因）。",
  "root": "overlay/runtime",
  "target": "~/.hermes/hermes-agent",
  "files": [
    {
      "source": "plugins/platforms/matrix/tools.py",
      "dest": "plugins/platforms/matrix/tools.py",
      "note": "matrix room 工具（含 is_async=True）"
    },
    {
      "source": "plugins/platforms/matrix/plugin.yaml",
      "dest": "plugins/platforms/matrix/plugin.yaml",
      "note": "provides_tools 声明"
    },
    {
      "source": "hermes_cli/kanban_db.py",
      "dest": "hermes_cli/kanban_db.py",
      "note": "C3: tasks 表 raci TEXT 列（schema/Task/create_task/INSERT）"
    },
    {
      "source": "hermes_cli/kanban_db_connect.py",
      "dest": "hermes_cli/kanban_db_connect.py",
      "note": "C3: 旧库 ALTER TABLE 自动迁移 raci"
    },
    {
      "source": "hermes_cli/kanban_output.py",
      "dest": "hermes_cli/kanban_output.py",
      "note": "C3: --json 输出含 raci"
    },
    {
      "source": "hermes_cli/kanban_parser.py",
      "dest": "hermes_cli/kanban_parser.py",
      "note": "C3: create 加 --raci JSON"
    },
    {
      "source": "hermes_cli/kanban.py",
      "dest": "hermes_cli/kanban.py",
      "note": "C3: _cmd_create 解析并透传 raci"
    },
    {
      "source": "tools/kanban_tools_schemas.py",
      "dest": "tools/kanban_tools_schemas.py",
      "note": "C3: kanban_create 工具 raci object 参数"
    },
    {
      "source": "tools/kanban_tools.py",
      "dest": "tools/kanban_tools.py",
      "note": "C3: 工具建卡透传 raci"
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "overlay/runtime 是 agent 运行时修复的源（含 is_async/provides_tools），deploy-agent-runtime 同步到 ~/.hermes；幂等、默认 dry-run。",
    "源须持续含全部运行时修复，否则同步会覆盖回退。"
  ]
}